{
    "title": "Graph Messenger",
    "description": "Graph Messenger is an advanced messaging app built using Telegram's API, offering all the benefits of Telegram plus innovative features such as:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udea9Multi-account management: Easily switch between unlimited accounts without logging out.\r\n\ud83d\udea9Download manager: Manage and organize your downloads efficiently.\r\n\ud83d\udea9Timeline: View and manage messages from different chats in a consolidated timeline.\r\n\ud83d\udea9Hidden Section: Hides chats and contacts, with the option to set password or pattern locks for additional privacy.\r\n\ud83d\udea9Auto Answer Machine: Automatically sends pre-set messages to contacts when you're unable to respond, acting as an auto-reply feature.\r\n\r\n\r\nAs an UNOFFICIAL app, it provides users with additional flexibility and customization options. Enjoy all the benefits of Telegram\u2014speed, security, cloud-based storage\u2014with the added power of new tools that enhance your messaging experience, including voice and video call support.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc5Key Features:\r\n\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fFull Telegram API integration\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fAdvanced multi-account system\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fBuilt-in download manager\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fExclusive timeline view for your chats\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fSecure, fast, and reliable\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc5Other comprehensive features:\r\n\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fVoice Changer: Modify your voice when sending voice messages for fun or privacy.\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fCustomizable Interface: Personalize your app with various themes, colors, and font options to match your style.\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fBot Account Login: login as bot account with the token you got from BotFather\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fHidden Chats: Keep certain chats private and hidden with password protection.\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fProxy Support: Easily connect via proxies for enhanced privacy and bypassing restrictions.\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fSend Drawing: Draw anything you like and send as message or sticker.\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fAdvanced Notifications: Customize notifications for specific chats or channels, including sounds and vibration patterns.\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fID Finder: Quickly find user profiles using their unique Telegram ID.\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fTabs & Folders: Organize your chats into custom folders or tabs for better navigation.\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fAuto-Reply: Set automated responses for incoming messages when you're away or busy.\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fBulk Message Deletion: Clear large numbers of messages quickly from any chat.\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fMessage Scheduling: Schedule messages to be sent at specific times to any contact or group.\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fAdvanced Media Sharing: Share large files, documents, or media without quality loss.\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fContact changes: can show contact changes like change name, avatar and phone in one page.\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fFavorite Messages: Add messages to favorite messages and show them in separate page.\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fHashtags+ : A place to track your favorite hashtags in the public posts.\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fCustomizable Menu Items: Can edit and customize main menu.\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fStory: Post stories with animated background.\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fCollapse long messages : When the message is long, it can be shortened.\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fChat Bar:  Ability to open other recent chats directly from the chat page.\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fSpecial contact: Notify you when your special contact is online.\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fFavorite Emojies: You can touch and add emojies to your favorite tab.\r\n\r\nTelegraph channel:\r\nhttps://t.me/app_telegraph",
    "descriptionHTML": "Graph Messenger is an advanced messaging app built using Telegram&#39;s API, offering all the benefits of Telegram plus innovative features such as:<br><br>\ud83d\udea9Multi-account management: Easily switch between unlimited accounts without logging out.<br>\ud83d\udea9Download manager: Manage and organize your downloads efficiently.<br>\ud83d\udea9Timeline: View and manage messages from different chats in a consolidated timeline.<br>\ud83d\udea9Hidden Section: Hides chats and contacts, with the option to set password or pattern locks for additional privacy.<br>\ud83d\udea9Auto Answer Machine: Automatically sends pre-set messages to contacts when you&#39;re unable to respond, acting as an auto-reply feature.<br><br><br>As an UNOFFICIAL app, it provides users with additional flexibility and customization options. Enjoy all the benefits of Telegram\u2014speed, security, cloud-based storage\u2014with the added power of new tools that enhance your messaging experience, including voice and video call support.<br><br>\ud83c\udfc5Key Features:<br><br>\u25aa\ufe0fFull Telegram API integration<br>\u25aa\ufe0fAdvanced multi-account system<br>\u25aa\ufe0fBuilt-in download manager<br>\u25aa\ufe0fExclusive timeline view for your chats<br>\u25aa\ufe0fSecure, fast, and reliable<br><br><br>\ud83c\udfc5Other comprehensive features:<br><br>\u25aa\ufe0fVoice Changer: Modify your voice when sending voice messages for fun or privacy.<br>\u25aa\ufe0fCustomizable Interface: Personalize your app with various themes, colors, and font options to match your style.<br>\u25aa\ufe0fBot Account Login: login as bot account with the token you got from BotFather<br>\u25aa\ufe0fHidden Chats: Keep certain chats private and hidden with password protection.<br>\u25aa\ufe0fProxy Support: Easily connect via proxies for enhanced privacy and bypassing restrictions.<br>\u25aa\ufe0fSend Drawing: Draw anything you like and send as message or sticker.<br>\u25aa\ufe0fAdvanced Notifications: Customize notifications for specific chats or channels, including sounds and vibration patterns.<br>\u25aa\ufe0fID Finder: Quickly find user profiles using their unique Telegram ID.<br>\u25aa\ufe0fTabs &amp; Folders: Organize your chats into custom folders or tabs for better navigation.<br>\u25aa\ufe0fAuto-Reply: Set automated responses for incoming messages when you&#39;re away or busy.<br>\u25aa\ufe0fBulk Message Deletion: Clear large numbers of messages quickly from any chat.<br>\u25aa\ufe0fMessage Scheduling: Schedule messages to be sent at specific times to any contact or group.<br>\u25aa\ufe0fAdvanced Media Sharing: Share large files, documents, or media without quality loss.<br>\u25aa\ufe0fContact changes: can show contact changes like change name, avatar and phone in one page.<br>\u25aa\ufe0fFavorite Messages: Add messages to favorite messages and show them in separate page.<br>\u25aa\ufe0fHashtags+ : A place to track your favorite hashtags in the public posts.<br>\u25aa\ufe0fCustomizable Menu Items: Can edit and customize main menu.<br>\u25aa\ufe0fStory: Post stories with animated background.<br>\u25aa\ufe0fCollapse long messages : When the message is long, it can be shortened.<br>\u25aa\ufe0fChat Bar:  Ability to open other recent chats directly from the chat page.<br>\u25aa\ufe0fSpecial contact: Notify you when your special contact is online.<br>\u25aa\ufe0fFavorite Emojies: You can touch and add emojies to your favorite tab.<br><br>Telegraph channel:<br>https://t.me/app_telegraph",
